Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8baac34630ab44935dacd82369459459","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are planning our destination wedding to Mexico! We are requesting guests come Wed-Sun (and earlier or later if they want), for our Friday wedding. The Wednesday when majority of everyone will be there, we are organizing a Welcome Dinner at the resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any advice on the best way to spread the word on this? Since we&#039;ll be handing out welcome bags AT that dinner... I can&#039;t really sneak it in there. Once details are in order I&#039;ll put it on the website... but any other thoughts? Did you all send emails\/other invites? Etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any thoughts would be greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892018,"PostDate":1428334370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning our destination wedding to Mexico! We are requesting guests come Wed-Sun (and earlier or later if they want), for our Friday wedding. The Wednesday when majority of everyone will be there, we are organizing a Welcome Dinner at the resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice on the best way to spread the word on this? Since we'll be handing out welcome bags AT that dinner... I can't really sneak it in there. Once details are in order I'll put it on the website... but any other thoughts? Did you all send emails\/other invites? Etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any thoughts would be greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423160562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26a7be686884f9744809f59f4a83b804","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I actually had this same thought. I was going to make a weekly itinerary and then realized that it will be included in the welcome bag that i&#039;m giving out the night of the welcome dinner. I&#039;m thinking of emailing everyone a week before the wedding with the arrangment of the welcome dinner.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892023,"PostDate":1428334741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I actually had this same thought. I was going to make a weekly itinerary and then realized that it will be included in the welcome bag that i'm giving out the night of the welcome dinner. I'm thinking of emailing everyone a week before the wedding with the arrangment of the welcome dinner.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.119.104.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84ffef596513dd0f13208782896436a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] So funny you started this thread, I&#039;ve been wondering the same thing and drafting an email to everyone. Hopefully that will work out well!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] Most of our guests will only be&amp;nbsp;at the resort&amp;nbsp;for Friday, Saturday and Sunday for our Saturday wedding, but since some people will be there earlier,&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to email everyone about a week before the wedding with info about our welcome party Friday night, and let them know that other wedding info (ceremony &amp;amp; reception location, time, etc.) will be in the welcome bag. Thank you for confirming that email is a possible way to go!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll let you both know if the email worked and everyone comes to the welcome party!&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp; 19 more days!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892027,"PostDate":1428335145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> So funny you started this thread, I've been wondering the same thing and drafting an email to everyone. Hopefully that will work out well!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> Most of our guests will only be\u00a0at the resort\u00a0for Friday, Saturday and Sunday for our Saturday wedding, but since some people will be there earlier,\u00a0I'm going to email everyone about a week before the wedding with info about our welcome party Friday night, and let them know that other wedding info (ceremony & reception location, time, etc.) will be in the welcome bag. Thank you for confirming that email is a possible way to go!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll let you both know if the email worked and everyone comes to the welcome party!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 19 more days!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8aa10fbe8b9121778ece1300438e7d4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think you can post it on your website without full details. We had all of our guests RSVP on our website and we set up the Welcome Dinner as a separate event to RSVP to. I wanted to make sure we knew who would be arriving in time to attend for accurate numbers. People were really good about RSVPing to both events.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our resort won&#039;t confirm the actual restaurant where the dinner will be until like 2 weeks before our wedding, so I left it general but with timing. I just said we&#039;ll meet in the lobby bar at 6:00 and then we&#039;ll walk to the restaurant together. I do have to provide entree selections for our guests as well, which is stressful without knowing which restaurant it&#039;ll be at! I just asked them to select Chicken\/Beef\/Fish without specifics on preparation.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We also have a Facebook group for our confirmed guests and we&#039;ll post it there before we go and then we&#039;ll also put an itinerary in their welcome bags!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892036,"PostDate":1428335751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think you can post it on your website without full details. We had all of our guests RSVP on our website and we set up the Welcome Dinner as a separate event to RSVP to. I wanted to make sure we knew who would be arriving in time to attend for accurate numbers. People were really good about RSVPing to both events.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our resort won't confirm the actual restaurant where the dinner will be until like 2 weeks before our wedding, so I left it general but with timing. I just said we'll meet in the lobby bar at 6:00 and then we'll walk to the restaurant together. I do have to provide entree selections for our guests as well, which is stressful without knowing which restaurant it'll be at! I just asked them to select Chicken\/Beef\/Fish without specifics on preparation.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We also have a Facebook group for our confirmed guests and we'll post it there before we go and then we'll also put an itinerary in their welcome bags!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.52.132.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca4fc84ffb28df633006ae377efa11ec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Perfect! Good luck :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892067,"PostDate":1428348019,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Perfect! Good luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428348591,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abbbbd697b7c89b337827cb97133f5f9","RawContent":"Congrats!\n\n\nWe had it on our wedding website but we also sent out a pre travel brochure with luggage tags that had this info in it as well.   Also two nights before we left I sent a mass email :). Hope that helps\n\n\nOn the wedding website I mentioned I had planned to do it, in the pre travel brochure I firmed up time and location for the welcome drinks but it wasn&#039;t until my mass email that I could confirm location of the rehearsal dinner as I didn&#039;t have this info from the resort yet. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892068,"PostDate":1428348498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats!<br><br>\nWe had it on our wedding website but we also sent out a pre travel brochure with luggage tags that had this info in it as well.   Also two nights before we left I sent a mass email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. Hope that helps<br><br>\nOn the wedding website I mentioned I had planned to do it, in the pre travel brochure I firmed up time and location for the welcome drinks but it wasn't until my mass email that I could confirm location of the rehearsal dinner as I didn't have this info from the resort yet. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.84.102.233","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"434b77037eedf6128a53854cdf5874a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] We had it on our wedding website and our passport invitation but I think people were STILL missing it (some ppl just dont read everything lol) so I sent out a reminders update survival guide last week and they really appreciated it :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;I started to write an email but then I changed it to this very simple mailout. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892126,"PostDate":1428396339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> We had it on our wedding website and our passport invitation but I think people were STILL missing it (some ppl just dont read everything lol) so I sent out a reminders update survival guide last week and they really appreciated it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>I started to write an email but then I changed it to this very simple mailout. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394209469,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1432531828","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":241,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09411023f19fed846a3e67cfa4c6476d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;victoriasalv&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;I did not send a separate invite for our welcome party because I just didn&#039;t think it was necessary\/thought it would be too much. We mentioned it to a lot of people in conversation. Coincidentally, I also just sent an email&amp;nbsp;to everyone&amp;nbsp;this morning with some additional details and put&amp;nbsp;the info&amp;nbsp;in the email, along with mention of dress codes at dinner and a very, very brief wedding day agenda (ceremony... cocktail hour... reception... and locations of each).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892132,"PostDate":1428401413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>victoriasalv<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0-\u00a0I did not send a separate invite for our welcome party because I just didn't think it was necessary\/thought it would be too much. We mentioned it to a lot of people in conversation. Coincidentally, I also just sent an email\u00a0to everyone\u00a0this morning with some additional details and put\u00a0the info\u00a0in the email, along with mention of dress codes at dinner and a very, very brief wedding day agenda (ceremony... cocktail hour... reception... and locations of each).<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402411989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c55a15f940e20b3c48a0de45192a088f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow, so glad I&#039;m not alone here! Thanks Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good idea about the email or separate mailer. We&#039;re having a large invite list (knowing a lot won&#039;t come) so I suppose once we start getting RSVP&#039;s I can either send a mailer or an email. I didn&#039;t capture a lot of email addresses, and since we have all the mailing addresses maybe i&#039;ll whip up something simple like a postcard. Thanks for all your advice!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smileitseb\"] oh my goodness, your survival guide is adorable!! What a genius idea. Thank you for sharing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892140,"PostDate":1428405962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow, so glad I'm not alone here! Thanks Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good idea about the email or separate mailer. We're having a large invite list (knowing a lot won't come) so I suppose once we start getting RSVP's I can either send a mailer or an email. I didn't capture a lot of email addresses, and since we have all the mailing addresses maybe i'll whip up something simple like a postcard. Thanks for all your advice!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277044\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277044-smileitseb\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smileitseb<\/span><\/a> oh my goodness, your survival guide is adorable!! What a genius idea. Thank you for sharing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423160562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.51.123.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79027,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428501619,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a46fceaefb8af334869e5b173a83238","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"victoriasalv\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am sending out an email this weekend (we are leaving on Wednesday, wedding is Friday) with \"reminders\" (wedding attire, restaurant dress codes, don&#039;t forget to pack..., etc).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have found that even though I have provided our wedding website SEVERAL times, people aren&#039;t so great at actually reading it and\/or retaining the information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Once our guests are at the resort, they will receive a welcome letter:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(I&#039;m still working on the letter... this is a draft printed on computer paper lol)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892341,"PostDate":1428501289,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am sending out an email this weekend (we are leaving on Wednesday, wedding is Friday) with \"reminders\" (wedding attire, restaurant dress codes, don't forget to pack..., etc).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have found that even though I have provided our wedding website SEVERAL times, people aren't so great at actually reading it and\/or retaining the information.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Once our guests are at the resort, they will receive a welcome letter:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1892341]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277418-0-89049600-1428515981.png\" title=\"welcome letter.png -  1.45MB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277418-0-89049600-1428515981.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"welcome letter.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>(I'm still working on the letter... this is a draft printed on computer paper lol)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/beach-wedding-dreams-riviera-cancun-tj\/'>My wedding pictures from Del Sol Photography<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396266119,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1429976005","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":21,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
