{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be77173dd3e85936b04dee0e22fe85a1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies! The opening of the bar has been pushed and it should be opening within a week or so but again nothing is for sure. Unfortunately this is how a lot of big renovations go. I&#039;ve already mentioned to the owner that we want to use it on the 14th but I&#039;m just not sure it will be all up and running.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think to be on the safe side we should have a back up location just in case. Ideas?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901603,"PostDate":1438259829,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies! The opening of the bar has been pushed and it should be opening within a week or so but again nothing is for sure. Unfortunately this is how a lot of big renovations go. I've already mentioned to the owner that we want to use it on the 14th but I'm just not sure it will be all up and running.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think to be on the safe side we should have a back up location just in case. Ideas?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99efcf6fa472b9e4b052ff10aa1c4646","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@snswedding2016&amp;nbsp; I agree. Hopefully the patio location will be open but anything can go wrong.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ladies - I&#039;m open to suggestions. I&#039;m afraid I&#039;m not very good with things downtown. I just found out we&#039;re having our Xmas doo at Copa Cabana on Adelaide. Don&#039;t know anything about it though. I can find out.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@deecol&amp;nbsp; We&#039;ll miss you!! But absolutely I say we can try a second date later on and see if the ladies that couldn&#039;t attend the first can make it for a second!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@veryvalentine&amp;nbsp; pleeeeeeeeeeeeease say you&#039;ll bring wedding pictures!!! I so can&#039;t wait to see them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can we do a roll call to see who is still available for August 14th and how big of a group? That might determine where we can go and where we can&#039;t.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901605,"PostDate":1438260572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@snswedding2016\u00a0 I agree. Hopefully the patio location will be open but anything can go wrong.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ladies - I'm open to suggestions. I'm afraid I'm not very good with things downtown. I just found out we're having our Xmas doo at Copa Cabana on Adelaide. Don't know anything about it though. I can find out.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@deecol\u00a0 We'll miss you!! But absolutely I say we can try a second date later on and see if the ladies that couldn't attend the first can make it for a second!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@veryvalentine\u00a0 pleeeeeeeeeeeeease say you'll bring wedding pictures!!! I so can't wait to see them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can we do a roll call to see who is still available for August 14th and how big of a group? That might determine where we can go and where we can't.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7c2faa0d054c8c127efddd7baa60dc7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m still available for that evening as well (excited!). I&#039;m not great with locations either haha. @[member=\"snswedding2016\"] Any other ideas for a backup? I feel like you know the city really well.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901611,"PostDate":1438262751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm still available for that evening as well (excited!). I'm not great with locations either haha. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> Any other ideas for a backup? I feel like you know the city really well.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1438276592,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92e157131c2430f5c0c4126c38aeec48","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] aw thanks - I think Sean and I just enjoy going out too much! haha!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ok here are some other ideas:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Oliver and Bonacini (Yonge and Front) - big patio, central location, more corporate crowd, Muskoka brewery is their sponsor this summer so their beer is on special (for the beer drinkers)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;El Catrin (Distillery District) - big patio, beautiful and fun decor, Mexican restaurant (goes with DW theme for most of us! ;) ) but the location isn&#039;t the best for those coming from the West End.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Black Bull (Queen and Soho\/Peter) - big patio, always busy, not the fanciest place, affordable, more of an artsy \"queen west\" crowd&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Beverly Hotel Rooftop (Queen and Beverly - just east of Spadina) - rooftop patio, cozy feel, smaller so depending on numbers it may be harder to get a larger group, a little pricier but a neat spot&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Brownstone Bistro (Yonge and Gloucester - just north of Wellesley) - medium sized patio, central location, reasonable prices&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;those are the places that come to mind off the top of my head. I&#039;ll keep thinking.....do any of these peak anyone&#039;s interest?&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;So far I have the following on the list for the 14th:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalentine\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"krystalball\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Meandhim\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JoannaBanana\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have I missed anyone?? Excited to meet you all in person!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901619,"PostDate":1438276569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> aw thanks - I think Sean and I just enjoy going out too much! haha!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ok here are some other ideas:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oliver and Bonacini (Yonge and Front) - big patio, central location, more corporate crowd, Muskoka brewery is their sponsor this summer so their beer is on special (for the beer drinkers)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901619]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-11046500-1438290356.jpg\" title=\"oliver and bonacini.jpg -  12.19KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-11046500-1438290356.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"oliver and bonacini.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>El Catrin (Distillery District) - big patio, beautiful and fun decor, Mexican restaurant (goes with DW theme for most of us! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> ) but the location isn't the best for those coming from the West End.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901619]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-33189500-1438290370.jpg\" title=\"el catrin.jpg -  144.22KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-33189500-1438290370.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"el catrin.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Black Bull (Queen and Soho\/Peter) - big patio, always busy, not the fanciest place, affordable, more of an artsy \"queen west\" crowd<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901619]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-71497600-1438290389.jpg\" title=\"Black Bull patio.jpg -  92.28KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-71497600-1438290389.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Black Bull patio.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Beverly Hotel Rooftop (Queen and Beverly - just east of Spadina) - rooftop patio, cozy feel, smaller so depending on numbers it may be harder to get a larger group, a little pricier but a neat spot<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901619]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-90890600-1438290401.jpg\" title=\"Beverly hotel rooftop.jpg -  68.98KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-90890600-1438290401.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Beverly hotel rooftop.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Brownstone Bistro (Yonge and Gloucester - just north of Wellesley) - medium sized patio, central location, reasonable prices<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901619]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-08553100-1438290448.jpg\" title=\"brownstone bistro.jpg -  102.38KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281055-0-08553100-1438290448.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"brownstone bistro.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>those are the places that come to mind off the top of my head. I'll keep thinking.....do any of these peak anyone's interest?<\/p>\n<br><p>So far I have the following on the list for the 14th:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281820\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281820-krystalball\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">krystalball<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282128-joannabanana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JoannaBanana<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have I missed anyone?? Excited to meet you all in person!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1438277197,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f9ab03ec71045cc5fd25875bdc0450a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Who was the new bride to be that was here a couple of days ago and she mentioned a \"meet\" with Toronto brides? I&#039;ll have to back track to find her name.... (old age again) I thought we had about 9 - the list seems a little shorter. I know a couple cancelled but it still seems like there should be more.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I didn&#039;t know Oliver &amp;amp; Bonnacini had a patio. That one is close for me lol So is Queen and Peter. Definitely somewhere with a backup location in case it rains.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@Ruzanna&amp;nbsp; did you add her? Not sure if she confirmed or not....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901621,"PostDate":1438277098,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Who was the new bride to be that was here a couple of days ago and she mentioned a \"meet\" with Toronto brides? I'll have to back track to find her name.... (old age again) I thought we had about 9 - the list seems a little shorter. I know a couple cancelled but it still seems like there should be more.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I didn't know Oliver & Bonnacini had a patio. That one is close for me lol So is Queen and Peter. Definitely somewhere with a backup location in case it rains.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@Ruzanna\u00a0 did you add her? Not sure if she confirmed or not....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":85,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
