Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.110.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78680,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c2e1b5f2fb2dcf699dde05c7c835d76","RawContent":"Oh, sisters...mine is pretty much the only one left to book and our deadline was 2\/6 :angry: Our travel agent told us the lowest room category is almost sold out, which I relayed to her, yet she still hasn&#039;t booked. I know she is coming, but the deposit is only $150! What&#039;s worse is she also had a destination wedding so she should understand, and I sure as heck didn&#039;t miss her booking deadline!\n\nI&#039;m also not even having a shower or bachelorette party for her to plan...so I&#039;m taking it pretty easy on her. All I ask is that she book...ARgh! (Rant over...ha.)\n[quote name=\"tan38\" post=\"1887355\" timestamp=\"1424799889\"]\nMy frustration is .. We told people back in June 2014 that we were having a DW in Jan\/Feb 2016 .. Almost 2 whole years in advance .. \"Start saving your toonies\" (A Canadian $2 coin).. We now have booked our resort, gotten pricing etc. .. and given people 6 weeks to put a deposit down .. I am getting people (my sister) saying \"We don&#039;t have the $$ for the deposit\" ..\n\nI told everyone back in June we were doing this and you didn&#039;t bother to save?? YET went on a cruise in December and were planning on a last minute trip in January that they didn&#039;t end up going on .. You can afford to do those things YET do not have the $$ for the deposit for your own sisters wedding .... *Sigh* .. And my other sister hasn&#039;t replied to any of the correspondence .. Not a peep!  \n\nI realize people have time but when you have given them so much notice and they didn&#039;t bother to prepare .. its upsetting ..\n\nVent over .. :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1887363,"PostDate":1424790027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh, sisters...mine is pretty much the only one left to book and our deadline was 2\/6 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/angry.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':angry:' \/> Our travel agent told us the lowest room category is almost sold out, which I relayed to her, yet she still hasn't booked. I know she is coming, but the deposit is only $150! What's worse is she also had a destination wedding so she should understand, and I sure as heck didn't miss her booking deadline!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also not even having a shower or bachelorette party for her to plan...so I'm taking it pretty easy on her. All I ask is that she book...ARgh! (Rant over...ha.)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tan38, on 24 February 2015 - 01:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>My frustration is .. We told people back in June\u00a02014 that we were having a DW in Jan\/Feb 2016 .. Almost 2 whole years in advance .. \"Start saving your toonies\" (A Canadian $2 coin).. We now have booked our resort, gotten pricing etc. .. and given people 6 weeks to put a deposit down .. I am getting people (my sister) saying \"We don't have the $$ for the deposit\" ..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I told everyone back in June we were doing this and you didn't bother to save??\u00a0YET went on a cruise in December and were planning on a\u00a0last minute trip in January that they didn't end up going on .. You can afford to do those things YET do not have the $$ for the deposit for your own sisters wedding\u00a0.... *Sigh* .. And my other sister hasn't replied to any of the correspondence ..\u00a0Not a peep! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I realize people have time but when you have given them so much notice and they didn't bother to prepare .. its upsetting ..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Vent over .. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.92.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78680,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"467dca41b1cc8b30c87d157cc7e8a999","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"beckys98\"] .. Ditto .. I don&#039;t want anything either ... My sister&#039;s deposit is a little more than $150 (its $150 x 4 ppl, my BIL and 2 nephews as well) but still I have given everyone MONTHS and MONTHS .. LOL .. *sigh* .. Oh well .. I am trying not to get too worked up ..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887366,"PostDate":1424790300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> .. Ditto .. I don't want anything either ... My sister's deposit is a little more than $150 (its $150 x 4 ppl, my BIL and 2 nephews as well) but still I have given everyone MONTHS and MONTHS .. LOL .. *sigh* .. Oh well .. I am trying not to get too worked up ..<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tanvan1976@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"64.231.128.246","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424275186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282157.png?_r=1425494284","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tan38","Id":282157,"Name":"tan38","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.14.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78680,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d33dfaa8c246616e22c187de631cd9b9","RawContent":"Omg my sister, my only sibling told me she didn&#039;t want to have to save even though I gave her 18 months notice, bc it would impact her daily quality of life to save for my wedding. That I&#039;m selfish and my wedding is not suppose to be for me, it&#039;s for my family,(mind you my family is my 2 children and their father) and the honeymoon should be when I travel!\n\n\nYou think she would put together a bridal shower or anything? Ha!\n\n\nI put together her entire bridal partly, she lives out of town btw, lugged her and her friends around Chicago 41\/2 hours away for her bachelorette party etc.\n\n\nPeople always put themselves first, and when you find someone who is considerate keep them around!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887428,"PostDate":1424821171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Omg my sister, my only sibling told me she didn't want to have to save even though I gave her 18 months notice, bc it would impact her daily quality of life to save for my wedding. That I'm selfish and my wedding is not suppose to be for me, it's for my family,(mind you my family is my 2 children and their father) and the honeymoon should be when I travel!<br><br>\nYou think she would put together a bridal shower or anything? Ha!<br><br>\nI put together her entire bridal partly, she lives out of town btw, lugged her and her friends around Chicago 41\/2 hours away for her bachelorette party etc.<br><br>\nPeople always put themselves first, and when you find someone who is considerate keep them around! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78680,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae023afe1a86fcfa211569d5236989c1","RawContent":"@[member=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\"] Ouch! \nPeople can be so hurtful!!!! People also have $$$ and time for what they want to do. 18 mos is more than enoigh time. I had a friend tell me \"im not going to make your wedding. I like to hike and i dont want to sit around and drink\"...i appreciated her honesty.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887431,"PostDate":1424821949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278120\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a> Ouch! <br \/>People can be so hurtful!!!! People also have $$$ and time for what they want to do. 18 mos is more than enoigh time. I had a friend tell me \"im not going to make your wedding. I like to hike and i dont want to sit around and drink\"...i appreciated her honesty. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keredondo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403631619,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecomingaRiggio","Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78680,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12302d02b648b6b1860dacff345260d0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BecomingaRiggio\" post=\"1887431\" timestamp=\"1424836349\"]\n@[member=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\"] Ouch! \nPeople can be so hurtful!!!! People also have $$$ and time for what they want to do. 18 mos is more than enoigh time. I had a friend tell me \"im not going to make your wedding. I like to hike and i dont want to sit around and drink\"...i appreciated her honesty.[\/quote]I also appreciate honesty but there is tonnes to see in foot in Mexico or any country ;) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n[quote name=\"tan38\" post=\"1887366\" timestamp=\"1424804700\"]\n@[member=\"beckys98\"] .. Ditto .. I don&#039;t want anything either ... My sister&#039;s deposit is a little more than $150 (its $150 x 4 ppl, my BIL and 2 nephews as well) but still I have given everyone MONTHS and MONTHS .. LOL .. *sigh* .. Oh well .. I am trying not to get too worked up ..[\/quote]I had a sister like this. I have enough next pay day to put down my deposit, oh it&#039;ll be after this or that and 90 days later my aunt had to pay her deposit. There will always be one. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1887435,"PostDate":1424822193,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BecomingaRiggio, on 24 February 2015 - 11:52 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278120\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a> Ouch! <br>\nPeople can be so hurtful!!!! People also have $$$ and time for what they want to do. 18 mos is more than enoigh time. I had a friend tell me \"im not going to make your wedding. I like to hike and i dont want to sit around and drink\"...i appreciated her honesty.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI also appreciate honesty but there is tonnes to see in foot in Mexico or any country <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tan38, on 24 February 2015 - 03:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> .. Ditto .. I don't want anything either ... My sister's deposit is a little more than $150 (its $150 x 4 ppl, my BIL and 2 nephews as well) but still I have given everyone MONTHS and MONTHS .. LOL .. *sigh* .. Oh well .. I am trying not to get too worked up ..<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI had a sister like this. I have enough next pay day to put down my deposit, oh it'll be after this or that and 90 days later my aunt had to pay her deposit. There will always be one. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.14.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78680,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6d7d5f97a69ee0fefc7883503f1c1f9","RawContent":"I made so many trips to Indianapolis cooked, cleaned, made decor\/invites was running around on her wedding day fulfilling any and every request.  And I still would. It&#039;s amazing how people forget how to treat others when they are not in need. At minimum be honest and upfront and it wouldn&#039;t hurt to exercise a bit of grace if telling a bride you can not attend her wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887437,"PostDate":1424822618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I made so many trips to Indianapolis cooked, cleaned, made decor\/invites was running around on her wedding day fulfilling any and every request.  And I still would. It's amazing how people forget how to treat others when they are not in need. At minimum be honest and upfront and it wouldn't hurt to exercise a bit of grace if telling a bride you can not attend her wedding. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":26,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
