{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":865,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1894961,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282893,"Name":"giigiixo","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282893.jpg?_r=1431636438","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1430408411,"LastPoster":{"Id":284141,"Name":"Morgan123","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1901177,"PostDate":1437899165,"PostContent":"Hi I hope some one out there can help me we went to the Roylton in April fantastic resort we ce h...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolecox66@icloud.com","IpAddress":"176.24.142.133","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437898528,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Morgan123","Id":284141,"Name":"Morgan123","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.250.95","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a6b73d20485fa28d504feadf3940e63","RawContent":"We booked the DREAM package for our wedding the package costs $2000 pretty much. We had to contact the resort directl as we did not hire a wedding planner. They will send over pictures and pricing info. \n\nWe are getting married 05\/06\/16 \n\nWe are a year away!! I am trying o find others pictures of wedding ceremony&#039;s that were held there but they are so hard to find !! \n\nI want to see samples of hair &amp;amp; makeup on brides to see what we are looking at as I am a hairstylist and makeup artist I don&#039;t want to do my self as I would like the be pampered but if I must I will have to . \n\nWe are also debating on flying in our photographer and videographer as we can&#039;t find anything for the resort. \n\nAll I know is they is photo caribe but I want to see sample pictures of previous weddings they have done. Any more info guys would be great !! \n\nSo far we are getting married in the lobby gazebo but I&#039;m still debating that or the Eco garden gazebo ,,, originally wanted reception in the lobby gazebo area but that was take. Now we are having it but the pools . Looks gorgeous just parried about the boards that everyone has mentioned , don&#039;t want to have to get stuck or ruin shoes !!","Attachments":[],"Id":1894961,"PostDate":1430408411,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We booked the DREAM package for our wedding the package costs $2000 pretty much. We had to contact the resort directl as we did not hire a wedding planner. They will send over pictures and pricing info. <br>\nWe are getting married 05\/06\/16 <br>\nWe are a year away!! I am trying o find others pictures of wedding ceremony's that were held there but they are so hard to find !! <br>\nI want to see samples of hair & makeup on brides to see what we are looking at as I am a hairstylist and makeup artist I don't want to do my self as I would like the be pampered but if I must I will have to . <br>\nWe are also debating on flying in our photographer and videographer as we can't find anything for the resort. <br>\nAll I know is they is photo caribe but I want to see sample pictures of previous weddings they have done. Any more info guys would be great !! <br>\nSo far we are getting married in the lobby gazebo but I'm still debating that or the Eco garden gazebo ,,, originally wanted reception in the lobby gazebo area but that was take. Now we are having it but the pools . Looks gorgeous just parried about the boards that everyone has mentioned , don't want to have to get stuck or ruin shoes !! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20160506\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/be22\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a>","Email":"jessica.galvao21@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.250.95","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430220623,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282893.jpg?_r=1431636438","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"giigiixo","Id":282893,"Name":"giigiixo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.150.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdfac69c663af0d15d549c382bca7b76","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"giigiixo\"] Glad I could help :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895058,"PostDate":1430479124,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282893\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282893-giigiixo\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">giigiixo<\/span><\/a> Glad I could help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5d7d98ff60fdcf78844a44a28b55787","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;we have visited all the royalton resorts and are one of their top agencies. It is a great resort brand that is offering a wide range of accommodations and resorts amenities that work perfectly for a wedding. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let us know if you have any specific information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@TApatty was there recently.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895069,"PostDate":1430485055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>we have visited all the royalton resorts and are one of their top agencies. It is a great resort brand that is offering a wide range of accommodations and resorts amenities that work perfectly for a wedding. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let us know if you have any specific information.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@TApatty was there recently.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"129.49.183.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76060f3a23bfeb46386caf70dacd382d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;There is a fb group called Royalton Punta Cana Brides. I got married their 4\/8\/2015 and the group helped a whole lot!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895682,"PostDate":1431015407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>There is a fb group called Royalton Punta Cana Brides. I got married their 4\/8\/2015 and the group helped a whole lot!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lillianvldz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"129.49.183.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431015238,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283017.jpg?_r=1431982446","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"larubia","Id":283017,"Name":"larubia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"186.6.199.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78926bf3183bf878ca23db7e871fe464","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone ,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just letting you know you can book our services for The Royalton , you don\u00b4t need to pay a vendor fee ,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Contact us at:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;info@manniapuntacana.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898096,"PostDate":1433774178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone ,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just letting you know you can book our services for The Royalton , you don\u00b4t need to pay a vendor fee ,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Contact us at:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>info@manniapuntacana.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.manniacancun.com.mx'>DJ SERVICE CANCUN ,RIVIERA MAYA ,MX , PUNTA CANA D.R.<br \/>\nhttp:\/\/www.manniacancun.com.mx<\/a>","Email":"carlosmartinez@manniacancun.com.mx","IpAddress":"187.153.96.158","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238554740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216337.jpg?_r=1393909989","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DJMannia","Id":216337,"Name":"DJMannia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.98.6.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc08f6bb31ab52183dd2e497dec908d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at&amp;nbsp;the Royalton in 2017. Does anyone have the different wedding packages we could look at? thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900549,"PostDate":1436993472,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at\u00a0the Royalton in 2017. Does anyone have the different wedding packages we could look at? thanks<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"okomkova@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"50.98.6.236","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436992993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheRuskieBride","Id":283984,"Name":"TheRuskieBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"176.24.142.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"465c6d499ad90b55af6d016e79de6cee","RawContent":"Hi I hope some one out there can help me we went to the Roylton in April fantastic resort we ce home and booked our wedding for April 2016 I never imaged what a nightmare it&#039;s turning out to be with all the paperwork which is needed the price for that is just over \u00a31300 we are only having the love package has there&#039;s only us 2 going to be there we haven&#039;t had any information we watched a wedding every day there we won&#039;t to get married on the beach under a gazebo there put a bit of linen on it which we have found out that&#039;s not included and cost \u00a3450 for that I no it&#039;s a while of yet but it would be fantastic if some 1 cud send me some information thank you Carole","Attachments":[],"Id":1901177,"PostDate":1437899165,"PostContent":"            <html>\r