> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.241.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76987,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b47faf750bb7163fabf305334e1ed7a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"McIrving\" post=\"1855937\" timestamp=\"1403097447\"]\nGlad you all found it helpful!\n \n@NOOB, I sent you some photos, please let me know if there is an issue.[\/quote]Meant to say @[member=\"Feath07\"]... Oops\n\n@[member=\"DawnBP\"] I would definitely recommend getting in touch with Claribel. It really made everything run much more smoothly once we got in touch with her. Also, regarding the vendor fee: it is definitely a big pain in the butt but unfortunately I did not find a way around it.  All I can say is that PhotoSouvenir was definitely worth the extra money! We felt so much more comfortable with them then with the on-site photographers, and did everything exactly as they said they would (and then some!).","Attachments":[],"Id":1856836,"PostDate":1403654037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>McIrving, on 18 June 2014 - 09:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nGlad you all found it helpful!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n@NOOB, I sent you some photos, please let me know if there is an issue.<\/p><\/div><\/div>Meant to say @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276610\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276610-feath07\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Feath07<\/span><\/a>... Oops<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278309\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278309-dawnbp\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DawnBP<\/span><\/a> I would definitely recommend getting in touch with Claribel. It really made everything run much more smoothly once we got in touch with her. Also, regarding the vendor fee: it is definitely a big pain in the butt but unfortunately I did not find a way around it.  All I can say is that PhotoSouvenir was definitely worth the extra money! We felt so much more comfortable with them then with the on-site photographers, and did everything exactly as they said they would (and then some!).\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerikmckenzie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.241.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399225994,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277830.jpg?_r=1399241007","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McIrving","Id":277830,"Name":"McIrving","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"85.115.54.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76987,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1de7aca9b7d100243f6bc7b6fd14bdb1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"McIrving\" post=\"1856836\" timestamp=\"1403668437\"]\nMeant to say @[member=Feath07]... Oops\n\n@[member=DawnBP] I would definitely recommend getting in touch with Claribel. It really made everything run much more smoothly once we got in touch with her. Also, regarding the vendor fee: it is definitely a big pain in the butt but unfortunately I did not find a way around it. All I can say is that PhotoSouvenir was definitely worth the extra money! We felt so much more comfortable with them then with the on-site photographers, and did everything exactly as they said they would (and then some!).[\/quote]Thanks for the advice :)\n\nWell since this post I have organised everything with Laura and have not had any trouble at all, I honestly can&#039;t fault her at the moment, I do however copy Claribel into every email so she is aware of the plans. Everything seems to be going smoothly and I like I say I haven&#039;t had any issues so can&#039;t grumble :)\nI think with ours only being a small wedding with 10 people there is much to organise and so I don&#039;t think too much could go wrong...I hope :)\n\nOur vendor fee has been waived as my photographer is flying in from Orlando and staying on site for 3 nights. If they stay on site for 3 nights or more the vendor fee gets waived :)\n\n13 weeks today till we fly.....eeekkk!","Attachments":[],"Id":1856841,"PostDate":1403670672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-time=\"1403668437\" data-cid=\"1856836\" data-author=\"McIrving\"><p>Meant to say @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276610\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276610-feath07\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Feath07<\/span><\/a>... Oops<br><br>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278309\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278309-dawnbp\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DawnBP<\/span><\/a> I would definitely recommend getting in touch with Claribel. It really made everything run much more smoothly once we got in touch with her. Also, regarding the vendor fee: it is definitely a big pain in the butt but unfortunately I did not find a way around it. All I can say is that PhotoSouvenir was definitely worth the extra money! We felt so much more comfortable with them then with the on-site photographers, and did everything exactly as they said they would (and then some!).<\/p><\/blockquote><br>Thanks for the advice <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>Well since this post I have organised everything with Laura and have not had any trouble at all, I honestly can't fault her at the moment, I do however copy Claribel into every email so she is aware of the plans. Everything seems to be going smoothly and I like I say I haven't had any issues so can't grumble <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>I think with ours only being a small wedding with 10 people there is much to organise and so I don't think too much could go wrong...I hope <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>Our vendor fee has been waived as my photographer is flying in from Orlando and staying on site for 3 nights. If they stay on site for 3 nights or more the vendor fee gets waived <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>13 weeks today till we fly.....eeekkk!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dawn.b-pyne@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"86.171.57.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402203555,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278309.jpg?_r=1402218389","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DawnBP","Id":278309,"Name":"DawnBP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.96.28.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76987,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db9cc519a06fac26db0d83a5d126574b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations , your post is really helpful.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858538,"PostDate":1404779041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations , your post is really helpful.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 AnnaTennille & Eric<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 May 16, 2015<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Montego Bay, Jamaica<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150516\/e\/The+Day+We+Say+I+Do%21\/k\/b124\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"a.johnson1013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.108.237.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403184280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278601.jpg?_r=1403203318","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"atennille","Id":278601,"Name":"atennille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.176.222.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76987,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34ab871a4d933e30781bd49cefef5fd5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"McIrving\"] Thank you so much for the great review. I am getting married at Royalton on August 1, 2015.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also can&#039;t see the pictures, please I do not have enough post. Would it be possible to email the pictures to me. I would greatly appreciate it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;gigglescastellanos24@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871502,"PostDate":1410441092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277830\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277830-mcirving\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">McIrving<\/span><\/a> Thank you so much for the great review. I am getting married at Royalton on August 1, 2015.<\/p>\n<p>I also can't see the pictures, please I do not have enough post. Would it be possible to email the pictures to me. I would greatly appreciate it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>gigglescastellanos24@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gigglescastellanos24@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.143.62.227","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399994934,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277953.jpg?_r=1400073269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gigglescastellanos24","Id":277953,"Name":"gigglescastellanos24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76987,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b46451cc5bf48fc5fa1a0989d943e77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871529,"PostDate":1410448051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"111.88.235.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76987,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc777b0fb3352b151647227053845744","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I never knew there could be so much loveliness in one post! I thought I was over looking at wedding forum until I came across this! Wedding day is one the most beautiful day for bride, groom and their family members. So they should celebrate this day and wear on the most elegant and attractive dresses. I bought my dress from HouseOfBrides.com, that dress was elegant, it made my wedding day..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891983,"PostDate":1428322104,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I never knew there could be so much loveliness in one post! I thought I was over looking at wedding forum until I came across this! Wedding day is one the most beautiful day for bride, groom and their family members. So they should celebrate this day and wear on the most elegant and attractive dresses. I bought my dress from HouseOfBrides.com, that dress was elegant, it made my wedding day..<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"styllamkr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"119.73.1.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428221314,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jennyy89","Id":282633,"Name":"jennyy89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.250.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76987,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd93e62540f2ba7cc18909c20432bda3","RawContent":"I booked Royalton for May 6th of 2016 I went with the dreams package ! I originally booked the lobby gazebo but now seeing the garden gazebo I think I&#039;m in love !! So pretty !  How are the on site photographers ? Did they offer video?","Attachments":[],"Id":1894699,"PostDate":1430220808,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I booked Royalton for May 6th of 2016 I went with the dreams package ! I originally booked the lobby gazebo but now seeing the garden gazebo I think I'm in love !! So pretty !  How are the on site photographers ? Did they offer video? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20160506\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/be22\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a>","Email":"jessica.galvao21@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.250.95","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430220623,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282893.jpg?_r=1431636438","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"giigiixo","Id":282893,"Name":"giigiixo","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
