zps8645dc8b.jpg\"><\/span>10 Starfish Aisle Markers - White finger starfish and raffia. \u00a0I used these for my beach wedding and they really added a pretty touch to the ceremony location on the beach. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These also travel well. \u00a0If desired - you could also add ribbons in your wedding colors. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will also include a large package of the raffia.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>$30 for all 10 and the Raffia bundle plus the cost of shipping. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tripledobedare@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.231.156.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345162376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259268.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dobedare","Id":259268,"Name":"dobedare","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.99.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78724,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afa8702e8f764fdef8784e45eea718b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Do you have any photos that you can add in? For some reason the one you posted isn&#039;t opening.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885013,"PostDate":1422917120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n        