tyle=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;arial narrow&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;Custom Italian Short Sleeve Linen Shirt -&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;arial narrow&#039;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"&gt;Colima (embroidery design)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;arial narrow&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;Color : White (Embroidery Color: 2227)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;arial narrow&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;Size: X-Large (Relaxed Fit)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingtropics.com\/shop\/for-the-groom\/colima-custom-italian-linen-shirt\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingtropics.com\/shop\/for-the-groom\/colima-custom-italian-linen-shirt\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898125,"PostDate":1433799607,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Selling the shirts that my husband and step-son wore for our wedding from Wedding Tropics. \u00a0Shirts are in perfect condition. \u00a0Dry cleaned and ready to wear.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The shirts are short sleeved. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>$30 for each shirt + shipping<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The first shirt was hubby's. \u00a0For reference - he is 6'4\" and about 220 lb<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">Custom Italian Short Sleeve Linen Shirt --\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Durban (embroidery\u00a0design)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">Color : Ivory Linen \/ Ivory Embroidery<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">Collar: Dress Regular<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">Size: 1X-Large (Relaxed Fit)<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtropics.com\/shop\/for-the-groom\/durban-custom-italian-linen-shirts\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingtr...n-linen-shirts\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">2nd shirt was white linen with a Tiffany Blue embroidery. \u00a0Stepson - 6' \/ 200 lb<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">Custom Italian Short Sleeve Linen Shirt -\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">Colima (embroidery design)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">Color : White (Embroidery Color: 2227)<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'arial narrow', sans-serif;\">Size: X-Large (Relaxed Fit)<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtropics.com\/shop\/for-the-groom\/colima-custom-italian-linen-shirt\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingtr...an-linen-shirt\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\