while, but I just couldn&#039;t get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would&#039;ve been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_1823\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_2332\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Steps to DIY:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1.) Download template and input your info&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2.) Print the image&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3.) Scan that image&amp;nbsp; (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 5.) Print the image onto cardstock&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 6.) Decorate as you like!&amp;nbsp; (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13511&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;DIY save the date. template.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;113&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13512&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;DIY save the date. template.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;113&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1732196,"PostDate":1363010606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn't get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would've been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_1823\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_2332\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Steps to DIY:<\/p> <p> 1.) Download template and input your info<\/p> <p> 2.) Print the image<\/p> <p> 3.) Scan that image\u00a0 (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page)<\/p> <p> 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page<\/p> <p> 5.) Print the image onto cardstock<\/p> <p> 6.) Decorate as you like!\u00a0 (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13511\",\"name\":\"DIY save the date. template.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"113\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13512\",\"name\":\"DIY save the date. template.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"113\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BethS.RN007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"134.174.21.190","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361570583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266460.jpg?_r=1395588404","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"UMassRN007","Id":266460,"Name":"UMassRN007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":fa