:"","Email":"lyna_89_07@mugglenet.com","IpAddress":"172.8.174.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362343091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lyna89","Id":266841,"Name":"lyna89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67ea138dfd7c2caa182cf7ffd84dcf32","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]aleedoc17[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n very cute! \n unfortunately I won&#039;t be able to download for quite some more posts, haha. \n Where did you find the rope from? \n I&#039;m contemplating whether to make the tags for my welcome bags out of material or just paper..[\/quote] \n Same here! Not exacltey sure how many points I need, but it&#039;s taking forever to get there....hopefully i&#039;ll have enough before I get married lol....  I got all of my supplies at ACMoore (a craft store in my area) , I found the rope in the bead making section.. \n \n When and where are you guys getting married?","Attachments":[],"Id":1733634,"PostDate":1363257184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>aleedoc17<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> very cute!<\/p> <p> unfortunately I won't be able to download for quite some more posts, haha.<\/p> <p> Where did you find the rope from?<\/p> <p> I'm contemplating whether to make the tags for my welcome bags out of material or just paper..<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Same here! Not exacltey sure how many points I need, but it's taking forever to get there....hopefully i'll have enough before I get married lol....\u00a0 I got all of my supplies at ACMoore (a craft store in my area) , I found the rope in the bead making section..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> When and where are you guys getting married?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BethS.RN007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"134.174.21.190","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361570583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266460.jpg?_r=1395588404","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"UMassRN007","Id":266460,"Name":"UMassRN007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc5b911289fa7e6b2ee08325b2cdc9f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; UMassRN007&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Maui, Hawaii -- August 17, RIGHT AROUND THE CORNER!! ahhhh&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; at least you have some time!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1733787,"PostDate":1363273438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> UMassRN007<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Maui, Hawaii -- August 17, RIGHT AROUND THE CORNER!! ahhhh<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> at least you have some time!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aleedoc17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361649075,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aleedoc17","Id":266489,"Name":"aleedoc17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1bafbb65fca11d0bf6e51054532c892","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]UMassRN007[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn&#039;t get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would&#039;ve been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.  \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n Steps to DIY: \n 1.) Download template and input your info \n 2.) Print the image \n 3.) Scan that image  (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page) \n 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page \n 5.) Print the image onto cardstock \n 6.) Decorate as you like!  (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge) \n \n ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!! \n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote] \n I can&#039;t download the template, could you email them to me? [email=\"nadinemeilleur@gmail.com\"]nadinemeilleur@gmail.com[\/email] thank you so very much!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1733917,"PostDate":1363288450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>UMassRN007<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn't get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would've been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_1823\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_2332\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Steps to DIY:<\/p> <p> 1.) Download template and input your info<\/p> <p> 2.) Print the image<\/p> <p> 3.) Scan that image\u00a0 (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page)<\/p> <p> 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page<\/p> <p> 5.) Print the image onto cardstock<\/p> <p> 6.) Decorate as you like!\u00a0 (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13511\",\"name\":\"DIY save the date. template.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"113\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13512\",\"name\":\"DIY save the date. template.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"113\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><\/blockquote> <p> I can't download the template, could you email them to me? <a href='mailto:nadinemeilleur@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>nadinemeilleur@gmail.com<\/a> thank you so very much!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadinemeilleur@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.4.90.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357576470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264014.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nadine2014","Id":264014,"Name":"nadine2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c867b69b83405b6948f50daabf95610","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks everyone :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1734515,"PostDate":1363397188,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks everyone <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BethS.RN007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"134.174.21.190","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361570583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266460.jpg?_r=1395588404","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"UMassRN007","Id":266460,"Name":"UMassRN007","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73113","Title":"DIY Luggage tag Save-The-Date (with template!)","LastPostDate":1438161796},"Pages":{"TotalItems":51,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
