{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c387c4ebb4988033e153efe02eefbf6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]UMassRN007[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn&#039;t get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would&#039;ve been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.  \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n Steps to DIY: \n 1.) Download template and input your info \n 2.) Print the image \n 3.) Scan that image  (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page) \n 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page \n 5.) Print the image onto cardstock \n 6.) Decorate as you like!  (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge) \n \n ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!! \n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote] \n Awesome! Thank you for his document! Needed this to create our program.","Attachments":[],"Id":1738914,"PostDate":1364359311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>UMassRN007<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn't get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would've been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_1823\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363023895102_2332\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Steps to DIY:<\/p> <p> 1.) Download template and input your info<\/p> <p> 2.) Print the image<\/p> <p> 3.) Scan that image\u00a0 (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page)<\/p> <p> 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page<\/p> <p> 5.) Print the image onto cardstock<\/p> <p> 6.) Decorate as you like!\u00a0 (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13511\",\"name\":\"DIY save the date. template.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"113\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13512\",\"name\":\"DIY save the date. template.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"113\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><\/blockquote> <p> Awesome! Thank you for his document! Needed this to create our program.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olivepanes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.90.49.194","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1322572576,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248159.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"olive0y1","Id":248159,"Name":"olive0y1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a485714f964ef261d9da70a8e0720ca9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great, so glad to help! Let me know if you have any questions :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1738976,"PostDate":1364378568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great, so glad to help! Let me know if you have any questions <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BethS.RN007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"134.174.21.190","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361570583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266460.jpg?_r=1395588404","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"UMassRN007","Id":266460,"Name":"UMassRN007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"599b2d60996f966faa37164901c8c569","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi, I can download the template either. Can you please e-mail to me as well? Thank you so much!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; anastacia.waller@gmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750867,"PostDate":1366910745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, I can download the template either. Can you please e-mail to me as well? Thank you so much!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> anastacia.waller@gmail.com<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anastacia.waller@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366910677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268978.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anastaciawaller","Id":268978,"Name":"anastaciawaller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa8d7e2bb4d4e6f625f58d20de1013b9","RawContent":"Beautiful job!","Attachments":[],"Id":1750886,"PostDate":1366914605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Beautiful job!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kel123073@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.5.240.39","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1333036206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253364.jpg?_r=1389580952","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kel123073","Id":253364,"Name":"Kel123073","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":