":"&lt;p&gt; Me too! Me too? Could you email it to me, it won&#039;t let me download it! dldwenge@gmail.com??? Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1761478,"PostDate":1369593352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Me too! Me too? Could you email it to me, it won't let me download it! dldwenge@gmail.com??? Thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dldwenge@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369592833,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269974.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Deanna Lee","Id":269974,"Name":"Deanna Lee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"742c8174bc78821bb2f2dddbd60796c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; what a great idea, i have been seeing these they are excellent are you able to email me as i cant open the doc? ajjcs@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1764532,"PostDate":1370387631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> what a great idea, i have been seeing these they are excellent are you able to email me as i cant open the doc? ajjcs@hotmail.com<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ajjcs@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370387228,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270281.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ajjcst","Id":270281,"Name":"ajjcst","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9a365d8eee2bd48088d7ac6faf33be3","RawContent":"Me too please Lorijeanmitchell@hotmail.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1774914,"PostDate":1372810224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Me too please Lorijeanmitchell@hotmail.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lorijeanmitchell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.41.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1298079077,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236954.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsbrowntobe","Id":236954,"Name":"mrsbrowntobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"771a55a1bae99dc866a9aa81ec413d6c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"UMassRN007\"]\nHey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn&#039;t get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would&#039;ve been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.  [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"&gt; [\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"&gt; [\/url] Steps to DIY: 1.) Download template and input your info 2.) Print the image 3.) Scan that image  (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page) 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page 5.) Print the image onto cardstock 6.) Decorate as you like!  (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge) ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!! [ATTACHMENT=13511]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT] [ATTACHMENT=13512]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT][\/quote] Great job...thanks for sharing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1775468,"PostDate":1372972113,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"UMassRN007\" url=\"\/t\/85401\/diy&#045;luggage&#045;tag&#045;save&#045;the&#045;date&#045;with&#045;template#post_1881765\"><p>Hey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn't get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would've been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"><\/span> <\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"><\/span> <\/a> Steps to DIY: 1.) Download template and input your info 2.) Print the image 3.) Scan that image\u00a0 (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page) 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page 5.) Print the image onto cardstock 6.) Decorate as you like!\u00a0 (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge) ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!! [ATTACHMENT=13511]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT] [ATTACHMENT=13512]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT]<\/p><\/blockquote> Great job...thanks for sharing!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aprilamoye@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1360579404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265936.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsMoye","Id":265936,"Name":"MrsMoye","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73113,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36983619f117ef1e91affc163ab56f8b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"UMassRN007\"]\nHey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn&#039;t get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would&#039;ve been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.  [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"&gt; [\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"&gt; [\/url] Steps to DIY: 1.) Download template and input your info 2.) Print the image 3.) Scan that image  (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page) 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page 5.) Print the image onto cardstock 6.) Decorate as you like!  (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge) ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!! [ATTACHMENT=13511]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT] [ATTACHMENT=13512]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT][\/quote] These are PERFECT is there any way you can email me the template to elmodelesline@yahoo.com I can&#039;t download yet :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1776975,"PostDate":1373455797,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"UMassRN007\" url=\"\/t\/85401\/diy&#045;luggage&#045;tag&#045;save&#045;the&#045;date&#045;with&#045;template#post_1881765\"><p>Hey everyone, I had been eyeballing luggage tag save-the-dates on Etsy for a while, but I just couldn't get myself to spend the $2 for each one. Considering i would have needed 70, that would've been around $140!! With lots of patience, I came up with my own template, and the results were better than I imagined. The best part about it, all of the supplies (cardstock, rope, magnets, paper slicer, envelopes) cost around $70.\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193078\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193078\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"><\/span> <\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"193079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 263px\"><\/span> <\/a> Steps to DIY: 1.) Download template and input your info 2.) Print the image 3.) Scan that image\u00a0 (there may be a way around this step, but I couldnt figure out how to copy an paste the entire image in order to print multiple tags per page) 4.) Open image in new document, re-size and copy\/paste so that you can print 4 per page 5.) Print the image onto cardstock 6.) Decorate as you like!\u00a0 (i used rope for a rustic feel,i also glued a tiny magnet onto the back so people can glue it to the fridge) ** Feel free to contact me with any questions, good luck!! [ATTACHMENT=13511]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT] [ATTACHMENT=13512]DIY save the date. template.docx (113k. docx file)[\/ATTACHMENT]<\/p><\/blockquote> These are PERFECT is there any way you can email me the template to elmodelesline@yahoo.com I can't download yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elmodelesline@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372894798,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271175.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HisFutureMrs","Id":271175,"Name":"HisFutureMrs","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":51,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
