Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":191,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":60331,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":590625,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":208425,"Name":"San Fran Sarah","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208425.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":69,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1234463320,"LastPoster":{"Id":284146,"Name":"carolinasfriend","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":74,"Preview":{"Id":590625,"PostDate":1234463320,"PostContent":"I found this DIY project that I am pretty excited about. I'm going to make LED \"throwies\" to put...","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;9;103\/st\/20090404\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-3\/k\/9e59\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...9e59\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sarah_averbach@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1201800827,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208425.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":69,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"San Fran Sarah","Id":208425,"Name":"San Fran Sarah","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31160,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b9f849d574428730291f6045f89d4b5","RawContent":"I found this DIY project that I am pretty excited about. I&#039;m going to make LED &amp;quot;throwies&amp;quot; to put inside chinese paper lanterns. This saves the hassle of dealing with electrical wiring. All you do is make these little throwies, attach then to the inside of your lanterns with clips or string, and then you can hang your lanterns with fishing wire. It can also save a bunch of money because the individual LED lights for lanterns are like $3 each. I just ordered my supplies (LED lights, batteries) I&#039;ll report back when I have finished the project. Here is two links that explain everything: \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i401.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp98\/saverba9\/s145734601.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i401.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp98\/saverba9\/PaperLanterns1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i401.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp98\/saverba9\/004_primary.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Now I just need to decide whether to use all white lanterns or colored lanterns (like the two pictures above). What do you all think? Are the colored lanterns going to look too cotton candy\/ kids party during the day?","Attachments":[],"Id":590625,"PostDate":1234463320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I found this DIY project that I am pretty excited about. I'm going to make LED \"throwies\" to put inside chinese paper lanterns. This saves the hassle of dealing with electrical wiring. All you do is make these little throwies, attach then to the inside of your lanterns with clips or string, and then you can hang your lanterns with fishing wire. It can also save a bunch of money because the individual LED lights for lanterns are like $3 each. I just ordered my supplies (LED lights, batteries) I'll report back when I have finished the project. Here is two links that explain everything: <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i401.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp98\/saverba9\/s145734601.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i401.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp98\/saverba9\/PaperLanterns1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i401.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp98\/saverba9\/004_primary.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Now I just need to decide whether to use all white lanterns or colored lanterns (like the two pictures above). What do you all think? Are the colored lanterns going to look too cotton candy\/ kids party during the day?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;9;103\/st\/20090404\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-3\/k\/9e59\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...9e59\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sarah_averbach@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1201800827,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208425.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":69,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"San Fran Sarah","Id":208425,"Name":"San Fran Sarah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31160,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bc18b31ad244618672c3e609754d78f","RawContent":"Wow! This is an ambitious project, but I can&#039;t wait to see how it turns out. I personally like the all white look because of the classy elegance it exudes. Good Luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":590654,"PostDate":1234464824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow! This is an ambitious project, but I can't wait to see how it turns out. I personally like the all white look because of the classy elegance it exudes. Good Luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pighin_e@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1217943744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210986.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Erin6341","Id":210986,"Name":"Eri