> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74238,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"556d08df6fd559f4b692908b3687f2e3","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Lydia1120[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Jenny, anyone reply yet and comment on your invites?   I LOVE them...I think you did such an amazing job!!![\/quote] \n \n Hi Lydia, \n \n Yes, finally! haha Most people received theirs within 2 days, but a wack of them took almost two weeks to get to their destinations! Which is nuts- my parents received theirs two days after, but our friend who lives in the same postal code, across the park from them, didn&#039;t get his until almost two weeks later! It was insane! My friend out in Calgary received hers before some local people received theirs! \n \n I haven&#039;t had any negative feedback! Not that I was expecting any- most people tend to keep their mean comments to themselves haha. \n \n My parent&#039;s loved theirs- my mom took it to work and showed it off to all her co-workers haha. They knew what I was doing, but they had NO concept of what it would look like. They were very impressed, and so have our friends been as well. My best friend out in Calgary was so amazed by it; and even though she can&#039;t come, I am glad I am still including her in everything, because she is my barometer for how things are looking- my other friend, who I assumed would be that, didn&#039;t even let me know she received hers! \n \n I know she did because she RSVP&#039;d on our website- but she never said anything to me!","Attachments":[],"Id":1771773,"PostDate":1372074827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Lydia1120<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Jenny, anyone reply yet and comment on your invites?\u00a0\u00a0 I LOVE them...I think you did such an amazing job!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Hi Lydia,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yes, finally! haha Most people received theirs within 2 days, but a wack of them took almost two weeks to get to their destinations! Which is nuts- my parents received theirs two days after, but our friend who lives in the same postal code, across the park from them, didn't get his until almost two weeks later! It was insane! My friend out in Calgary received hers before some local people received theirs!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I haven't had any negative feedback! Not that I was expecting any- most people tend to keep their mean comments to themselves haha.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My parent's loved theirs- my mom took it to work and showed it off to all her co-workers haha. They knew what I was doing, but they had NO concept of what it would look like. They were very impressed, and so have our friends been as well. My best friend out in Calgary was so amazed by it; and even though she can't come, I am glad I am still including her in everything, because she is my barometer for how things are looking- my other friend, who I assumed would be that, didn't even let me know she received hers!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I know she did because she RSVP'd on our website- but she never said anything to me!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny.mccallum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.49.159","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1351073287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261719.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenny2014","Id":261719,"Name":"Jenny2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74238,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"210015e5b97a2279cb3b1681566b9af8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Why wont it let me download your template?&lt;img id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1372370636505_1234\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1773222,"PostDate":1372356308,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Why wont it let me download your template?<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1372370636505_1234\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"asia.howell@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1372355530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/