morrow) as a result of what you did or did not do yesterday.\"<\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"wedding4marshalls@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1370685484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Recy","Id":270378,"Name":"Recy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74238,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f70e716dc12f79018983a2e0ba499d06","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Recy[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n WOW. These are nice How long did it take to make?[\/quote] \n \n SORRY it took me so long to reply! Gah! \n \n I intensively slaved over these for about a week solid. Worked 44 hours, and then came home and worked about 4 or 5 hours a night on them. In total, it probably took me about 70 hours from design research to sending them all out.","Attachments":[],"Id":1794080,"PostDate":1377261007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Recy<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> WOW. These are nice How long did it take to make?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> SORRY it took me so long to reply! Gah!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I intensively slaved over these for about a week solid. Worked 44 hours, and then came home and worked about 4 or 5 hours a night on them. In total, it probably took me about 70 hours from design research to sending them all out.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny.mccallum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.49.159","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1351073287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261719.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenny2014","Id":261719,"Name":"Jenny2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74238,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e57abaa5583b337d90d151ad3edad66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; OMG Jenny, less than a month to go!&amp;nbsp; Congratulations again and hope everything goes well!&amp;nbsp; Looking forward to hearing how it went and seeing pictures.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794586,"PostDate":1377448184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> OMG Jenny, less than a month to go!\u00a0 Congratulations again and hope everything goes well!\u00a0 Looking forward to hearing how it went and seeing pictures.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div><span>17 Years in the Making....and we love each other more now then ever!<\/span><\/div>\n<div>Post Wedding Items for Sale:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76047-post-wedding-sale-on-various-items\/%C2%A0'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76047-post-wedding-sale-on-various-items\/\u00a0<\/a><\/div>\n<div><span>Planning Thread Link:\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76083-revised-planning-journal-for-varadero-cuba-wedding-picture-heavy\/%C2%A0'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76083-revised-planning-journal-for-varadero-cuba-wedding-picture-heavy\/\u00a0<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>Wedding Dance Mash Up Video -\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=80jO9-B_BVI\" title=\"External link\">https:\/\/www.youtube....h?v=80jO9-B_BVI<\/a>","Email":"info@plankroadcottages.com","IpAddress":"142.46.193.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1353434511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262559.jpg?_r=1387220981","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lydia1120","Id":262559,"Name":"Lydia1120","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74238,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fc5f63b904419d1ef7678e973df7eb5","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Lydia1120[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n OMG Jenny, less than a month to go!  Congratulations again and hope everything goes well!  Looking forward to hearing how it went and seeing pictures.[\/quote] \n \n I wish :( \n \n It&#039;s actually less then a month, and a year haha! It&#039;s not until next September! Our legal ceremony is less than a month away, but our big wedding in PV is next year!","Attachments":[],"Id":1794662,"PostDate":1377503298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Lydia1120<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> OMG Jenny, less than a month to go!\u00a0 Congratulations again and hope everything goes well!\u00a0 Looking forward to hearing how it went and seeing pictures.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I wish <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It's actually less then a month, and a year haha! It's not until next September! Our legal ceremony is less than a month away, but our big wedding in PV is next year!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny.mccallum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.49.159","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1351073287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261719.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenny2014","Id":261719,"Name":"Jenny2014","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":95,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
