-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/seiym5.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/seiym5.png<\/a><br><span>16 Booked + Bride & Groom<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jol93@Hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1258846655,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223452.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jol93","Id":223452,"Name":"jol93","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48251,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3edb57742531a4a2e6bc7fde074fdb0","RawContent":"Beautiful and GREAT price, can&#039;t beat that.\n \n Question, how heavy are the vases? We were thinking about doing something similar, but we&#039;re trying to figure out how much they&#039;ll weigh down our baggage.","Attachments":[],"Id":1037051,"PostDate":1266338681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Beautiful and GREAT price, can't beat that.<br \/> <br \/> Question, how heavy are the vases? We were thinking about doing something similar, but we're trying to figure out how much they'll weigh down our baggage.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicoley812@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264020580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224897.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"coley88","Id":224897,"Name":"coley88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48251,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34fabaf298dd131fe3a923900aa1fb7f","RawContent":"This is beautiful! Great job!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1037098,"PostDate":1266339363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is beautiful! Great job!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dk@sc.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248313252,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219735.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":84,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ddk5576","Id":219735,"Name":"ddk5576","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48251,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4634ab5a8dc6fbf3ef789b68ac8f6034","RawContent":"These look great! Good job...\n \n ....another thought for people taking something like this with them. I have packed glasses home from trips before in my checked baggage. So far - knock on wood - I have not had any problems. I stuff them full of the small stuff that I don&#039;t have to worry about wrinkling...socks, underwear, tank tops, etc. Then you wrap them in tshirts or bubble wrap, put it in a plastic bag (just in case) and put them in the middle of the suitcase. Sounds like way more hassle than it is and I have been lucky.","Attachments":[],"Id":1037107,"PostDate":1266339495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These look great! Good job...<br \/> <br \/> ....another thought for people taking something like this with them. I have packed glasses home from trips before in my checked baggage. So far - knock on wood - I have not had any problems. I stuff them full of the small stuff that I don't have to worry about wrinkling...socks, underwear, tank tops, etc. Then you wrap them in tshirts or bubble wrap, put it in a plastic bag (just in case) and put them in the middle of the suitcase. Sounds like way more hassle than it is and I have been lucky.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;130\/st\/20100225\/e\/Our+Wedding%21\/dt\/-2\/k\/4d0e\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...4d0e\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rayaisme@telus.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1254581021,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222262.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Raykel","Id":222262,"Name":"Raykel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48251,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"780979c2327d79b7e16f1ad139bea7f3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;coley88&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Beautiful and GREAT price, can&#039;t beat that.\n \n Question, how heavy are the vases? We were thinking about doing something similar, but we&#039;re trying to figure out how much they&#039;ll weigh down our baggage.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;The vases are very light. I&#039;m still thinking how to pack them. Most likely will be in my carry-on. I have 11 people flying down with us. I can also ship them down just have to remove all Made in China stickers","Attachments":[],"Id":1037187,"PostDate":1266341908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>coley88<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Beautiful and GREAT price, can't beat that.<br \/> <br \/> Question, how heavy are the vases? We were thinking about doing something similar, but we're trying to figure out how much they'll weigh down our baggage.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>The vases are very light. I'm still thinking how to pack them. Most likely will be in my carry-on. I have 11 people flying down with us. I can also ship them down just have to remove all Made in China stickers\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>65 BOOKED PLUS BRIDE & GROOM<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dmvega@optimum.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238114546,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216200.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":99,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"damaris","Id":216200,"Name":"damaris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48251,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"To