ll,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":48251,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6329d0e40a455ab80e24459c8b9bded","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;coley88&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Beautiful and GREAT price, can&#039;t beat that.\n \n Question, how heavy are the vases? We were thinking about doing something similar, but we&#039;re trying to figure out how much they&#039;ll weigh down our baggage.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I am thinking the same thing. THere is no way I&#039;m bringing the ones I&#039;m making for my AHR. I&#039;m not bringing anything with me in terms of decorations for my DW. Fresh flowers is fine with me. There is no way I&#039;d bring all that down, but I give you guys lots of credit for packing all that up! They&#039;re all beautiful.","Attachments":[],"Id":1047353,"PostDate":1266944044,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>coley88<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Beautiful and GREAT price, can't beat that.<br \/> <br \/> Question, how heavy are the vases? We were thinking about doing something similar, but we're trying to figure out how much they'll weigh down our baggage.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I am thinking the same thing. THere is no way I'm bringing the ones I'm making for my AHR. I'm not bringing anything with me in terms of decorations for my DW. Fresh flowers is fine with me. There is no way I'd bring all that down, but I give you guys lots of credit for packing all that up! They're all beautiful.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100709\/e\/Amy+and+Kevin%27s+Wedding\/k\/e43d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e43d\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i192.photobucket.com\/albums\/z215\/amyrot\/AmyKevinMonosmall.jpg\">http:\/\/i192.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...nMonosmall.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/amykev\">www.mywedding.com\/amykev<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amyrotondo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1241141331,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217202.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyrot","Id":217202,"Name":"amyrot","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":tr