{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":56,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":13090,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1723315,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":260575,"Name":"MK0386","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260575.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1361358907,"LastPoster":{"Id":279711,"Name":"Bride2b15","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279711.jpg?_r=1410256327","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":74,"Preview":{"Id":1723315,"PostDate":1361358907,"PostContent":"My OOT bags are almost complete, but I figured I'd go ahead and share the Survival Kit that will...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meggs0386@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1348309413,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260575.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MK0386","Id":260575,"Name":"MK0386","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26dd27eefc97e97b08b6c76e01c72b03","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My OOT bags are almost complete, but I figured I&#039;d go ahead and share the Survival Kit that will go in the OOT bag!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This project was a lot of fun and thanks to the frugal brides OOT bag info thread... super cheap! That thread is here:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/80079\/frugal-brides-found-a-new-website&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I bought my items at the Dollar Store, Wal-Mart, and minimus.com.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is a list of what&#039;s in the Survival Kit:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1. DIY Personalized Chapstick - BulkApothecary.com - .14 cents\/each (my DIY thread is here:&amp;nbsp;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84966\/my-diy-chapstick-labels-for-oot-bag-with-pics-and-template)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2. Easy Mending Kit (thread, needle, safety pin) - Minimus.com- .27 cents\/each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3. Shout Wipes - Minimus.com- .43 cents\/each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4. Nail Polish Remover Pads - Minimus.com - .07 cents\/each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 5. Nail File - Dollar Store- bought a pack and it came to .03 cents\/each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 6. Cocoa Butter - Wal-Mart - .87 cents\/each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"line-height: 1.231;\"&gt;7. Sunscreen - Wal-Mart - .97 cents\/each&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 8. Wet Wipes - Dollar Store- .33 cents\/each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 9. Emergen-C - Minimus.com - .43 cents\/each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"line-height: 1.231;\"&gt;10.Razors - Wal-Mart- .17 cents\/each&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The bag has 2 or 3 of certain items so the total for each bag is only $5.04 and it&#039;s for 2 people b\/c each couple will share one bag and that is why there are 2 of certain items like the chapstick, razors, etc. I prob could have gotten certain things cheaper but I had already purchased certain things when I found out about minimus.com. That site is seriously awesome!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; (The OOT bag will also have a few more fun items! This is just the Survival Kit that goes IN the OOT bag)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Once I had my items, I was so excited to put a bag together and make a label for the top of the bag. I used zip lock baggies for the bag.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I designed a label, and then just saved it as &amp;nbsp;a .jpg and used Word to format 3 labels\/page. I then printed them on my printer at home, and trimmed them to the right size with a paper cutter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is my design:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361371328144_1315\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189323\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189323\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is the bag all put together:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Front:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361371328144_2837\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189324\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189324\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Back:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361371328144_4294\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189326\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189326\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning, ladies!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Let me know if you have any questions :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Megan&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1723315,"PostDate":1361358907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My OOT bags are almost complete, but I figured I'd go ahead and share the Survival Kit that will go in the OOT bag!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This project was a lot of fun and thanks to the frugal brides OOT bag info thread... super cheap! That thread is here:<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/80079\/frugal-brides-found-a-new-website' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...d-a-new-website<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I bought my items at the Dollar Store, Wal-Mart, and minimus.com.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is a list of what's in the Survival Kit:<\/p> <p> 1. DIY Personalized Chapstick - BulkApothecary.com - .14 cents\/each (my DIY thread is here:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84966\/my-diy-chapstick-labels-for-oot-bag-with-pics-and-template' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...cs-and-template<\/a>)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 2. Easy Mending Kit (thread, needle, safety pin) - Minimus.com- .27 cents\/each<\/p> <p> 3. Shout Wipes - Minimus.com- .43 cents\/each<\/p> <p> 4. Nail Polish Remover Pads - Minimus.com - .07 cents\/each<\/p> <p> 5. Nail File - Dollar Store- bought a pack and it came to .03 cents\/each<\/p> <p> 6. Cocoa Butter - Wal-Mart - .87 cents\/each<\/p> <p> <span>7. Sunscreen - Wal-Mart - .97 cents\/each<\/span><\/p> <p> 8. Wet Wipes - Dollar Store- .33 cents\/each<\/p> <p> 9. Emergen-C - Minimus.com - .43 cents\/each<\/p> <p> <span>10.Razors - Wal-Mart- .17 cents\/each<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The bag has 2 or 3 of certain items so the total for each bag is only $5.04 and it's for 2 people b\/c each couple will share one bag and that is why there are 2 of certain items like the chapstick, razors, etc. I prob could have gotten certain things cheaper but I had already purchased certain things when I found out about minimus.com. That site is seriously awesome!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> (The OOT bag will also have a few more fun items! This is just the Survival Kit that goes IN the OOT bag)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Once I had my items, I was so excited to put a bag together and make a label for the top of the bag. I used zip lock baggies for the bag.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I designed a label, and then just saved it as \u00a0a .jpg and used Word to format 3 labels\/page. I then printed them on my printer at home, and trimmed them to the right size with a paper cutter.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is my design:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361371328144_1315\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189323\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189323\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is the bag all put together:<\/p> <p> Front:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361371328144_2837\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189324\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189324\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Back:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361371328144_4294\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189326\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189326\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning, ladies!!<\/p> <p> Let me know if you have any questions <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> -Megan<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meggs0386@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1348309413,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260575.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MK0386","Id":260575,"Name":"MK0386","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc8e5643d26f3ab8ee7a47c30a93d67a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; What program did you use to design your labels? And did you have them professionally printed by Vista print like your cards? They look awesome! You&#039;ve done a great job!!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1723340,"PostDate":1361362021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> What program did you use to design your labels? And did you have them professionally printed by Vista print like your cards? They look awesome! You've done a great job!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamlove24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"23.24.145.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359496937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265358.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DiggityDawn","Id":265358,"Name":"DiggityDawn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23207c86ead6502c52ae8d72354b4bc5","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]DiggityDawn[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n What program did you use to design your labels? And did you have them professionally printed by Vista print like your cards? They look awesome! You&#039;ve done a great job!!\n[\/quote] \n thank you very much! I designed them using a program online: pcikmonkey.com. Then I saved the \"picture\" that I designed and inserted it into a Word document and printed them at home on my printer. :) Hope this helps! If you have never used picmonkey.com... you have to try it out... it&#039;s awesome!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1723342,"PostDate":1361362130,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>DiggityDawn<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> What program did you use to design your labels? And did you have them professionally printed by Vista print like your cards? They look awesome! You've done a great job!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> thank you very much! I designed them using a program online: pcikmonkey.com. Then I saved the \"picture\" that I designed and inserted it into a Word document and printed them at home on my printer. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Hope this helps! If you have never used picmonkey.com... you have to try it out... it's awesome!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meggs0386@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1348309413,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260575.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MK0386","Id":260575,"Name":"MK0386","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee04875a5dd227ced43deb49e0caf237","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MK0386[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n thank you very much! I designed them using a program online: pcikmonkey.com. Then I saved the \"picture\" that I designed and inserted it into a Word document and printed them at home on my printer. :) Hope this helps! If you have never used picmonkey.com... you have to try it out... it&#039;s awesome!![\/quote] \n Thanks, I will try it out! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1723680,"PostDate":1361394956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MK0386<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> thank you very much! I designed them using a program online: pcikmonkey.com. Then I saved the \"picture\" that I designed and inserted it into a Word document and printed them at home on my printer. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Hope this helps! If you have never used picmonkey.com... you have to try it out... it's awesome!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Thanks, I will try it out! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamlove24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"23.24.145.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359496937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265358.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DiggityDawn","Id":265358,"Name":"DiggityDawn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c57990fc439f865fc6a040f1269f14b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m loving all of your stuff so far!!!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1723702,"PostDate":1361398261,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=