t;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I need to start by thanking all of the past brides that helped me put together my passport pre travel brochure.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would like to share my project as I know there weren&#039;t any passport pre travel brochures out there when I was looking for ideas.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I started out by using Aylee&#039;s bits free passport template. I also got a lot of ideas and information from other brides&#039; brochures and passports ideas. I have included photos of the finished product and the initial document. I am sorry, I can&#039;t seem to find my final printable version but I would be glad to help you figure out how to print it. Formatting the pages is the most important part, numbering them is a must!! My FI is the IT pro so he formatted everything then I had to move pages around and number them correctly so I could print the pages back to back. I used metallic ivory cardstock for the cover.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;11132&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;modified passport AM.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;1,221&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"passport invite 2.gif\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/626787\/width\/478\/height\/640\" style=\"width: 343px; height: 460px;\" \/&gt;   &lt;img alt=\"passport 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/626791\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 413px; height: 308px;\" \/&gt;   &lt;img alt=\"invites.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/626797\/width\/600\/height\/448\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1557918,"PostDate":1324182213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ladies,<\/p> <p> I need to start by thanking all of the past brides that helped me put together my passport pre travel brochure.<\/p> <p> I would like to share my project as I know there weren't any passport pre travel brochures out there when I was looking for ideas.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I started out by using Aylee's bits free passport template. I also got a lot of ideas and information from other brides' brochures and passports ideas. I have included photos of the finished product and the initial document. I am sorry, I can't seem to find my final printable version but I would be glad to help you figure out how to print it. Formatting the pages is the most important part, numbering them is a must!! My FI is the IT pro so he formatted everything then I had to move pages around and number them correctly so I could print the pages back to back. I used metallic ivory cardstock for the cover.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"11132\",\"name\":\"modified passport AM.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"1,221\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"passport invite 2.gif\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/626787\/width\/478\/height\/640\" style=\"width: 343px; height: 460px;\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"passport 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/626791\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 413px; height: 308px;\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"invites.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/626797\/width\/600\/height\/448\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"annmaritjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"23.17.77.247","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302741762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238860.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amjohnson","Id":238860,"Name":"amjohnson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24be38849fed21fe88292788cc679e18","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Looks great!! Nice job :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1558677,"PostDate":1324411222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Looks great!! Nice job <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandy_pants123@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1287916644,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":189,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Manda123","Id":233455,"Name":"Manda123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c42445754f816909b751981857b38434","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great Job !!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1558680,"PostDate":1324412088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great Job !!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ywalters@qtcm.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304977435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239807.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YWS2012","Id":239807,"Name":"YWS2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56752d83478de1ee877fe35e3203a946","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Very Nice!!!!&amp;nbsp; Did you make the envelope too?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1558802,"PostDate":1324458865,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Very Nice!!!!\u00a0 Did you make the envelope too?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen.bonesz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"8.28.180.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304700902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239720.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"venus909","Id":239720,"Name":"venus909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16ca14a272c2ca6f9580ca9cb4740967","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; No I got them from a local store. But they have a web site.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Very Nice!!!!&amp;nbsp; Did you make the envelope too?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/blockquote&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1559130,"PostDate":1324513878,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> No I got them from a local store. But they have a web site.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Very Nice!!!!\u00a0 Did you make the envelope too?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"annmaritjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"23.17.77.247","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302741762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238860.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amjohnson","Id":238860,"Name":"amjohnson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9d0230b8d6d71b9c2739fb8e7d3c9e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow, this looks great Amjohnson. How did you cut it so it looks so perfect, and what size paper? I&#039;m working on a pre-travel brochure right now, and uncertain whether to do a passport style (seems like a lot work) or a tri-fold brochure that will be printed by Vistaprint. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1559538,"PostDate":1324618896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow, this looks great Amjohnson. How did you cut it so it looks so perfect, and what size paper? I'm working on a pre-travel brochure right now, and uncertain whether to do a passport style (seems like a lot work) or a tri-fold brochure that will be printed by Vistaprint. Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinksapphiregirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304096603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239459.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":237,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redginger","Id":239459,"Name":"redginger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b393c96b6d03ad3bd72d1f6d18a6891","RawContent":"Hi Redginger, \n It really wasn&#039;t too bad. The most work was formatting the pages by number in the right order so that they were back to back when you printed. I then put the printed booklets on top of the shimmer cardstock and left about .5 inches around. I got a corner punch at Walmart for 5$! The doc I posted isn&#039;t my final formatted copy. I will try and get my FI to send it to me from the other computer. I am also going to post more photos of the final invitations. I hope this helps!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]redginger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wow, this looks great Amjohnson. How did you cut it so it looks so perfect, and what size paper? I&#039;m working on a pre-travel brochure right now, and uncertain whether to do a passport style (seems like a lot work) or a tri-fold brochure that will be printed by Vistaprint. Thanks! \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1559627,"PostDate":1324654799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Redginger,<\/p> <p> It really wasn't too bad. The most work was formatting the pages by number in the right order so that they were back to back when you printed. I then put the printed booklets on top of the shimmer cardstock and left about .5 inches around. I got a corner punch at Walmart for 5$! The doc I posted isn't my final formatted copy. I will try and get my FI to send it to me from the other computer. I am also going to post more photos of the final invitations. I hope this helps!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>redginger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wow, this looks great Amjohnson. How did you cut it so it looks so perfect, and what size paper? I'm working on a pre-travel brochure right now, and uncertain whether to do a passport style (seems like a lot work) or a tri-fold brochure that will be printed by Vistaprint. Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"annmaritjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"23.17.77.247","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302741762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238860.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amjohnson","Id":238860,"Name":"amjohnson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75faf5ac8c643c3519366c37d3b99a9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here are some more photos of my passport brochure. I used different computers and photo devices to take photos, I am losing track of what I took with which device!lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"invite photo.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/640838\/width\/419\/height\/700\" \/&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"invite photo3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/640840\/width\/600\/height\/359\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1559628,"PostDate":1324655257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here are some more photos of my passport brochure. I used different computers and photo devices to take photos, I am losing track of what I took with which device!lol<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"invite photo.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/640838\/width\/419\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"invite photo3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/640840\/width\/600\/height\/359\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"annmaritjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"23.17.77.247","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302741762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238860.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amjohnson","Id":238860,"Name":"amjohnson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8255b5f7eebacf51c2e9ab8b6c16aad9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I reall really like your design wow!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1566396,"PostDate":1326207281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I reall really like your design wow!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leungbobe@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1325071392,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248991.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"leungbobe","Id":248991,"Name":"leungbobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22b2f7d0649bbfb7a42cdc46a31fe1b8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Gorgeous, thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1585699,"PostDate":1329941950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Gorgeous, thanks for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christy.opperman@selu.edu","IpAddress":"66.186.249.133","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304185521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239490.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MCree","Id":239490,"Name":"MCree","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"64887","Title":"My DIY Passport Pre Travel Brochure","LastPostDate":1410525074},"Pages":{"TotalItems":18,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
