anEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51182,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08eb3851d86f6c4d3e0d12cf35729519","RawContent":"I&#039;m anxious too! Please post soon. Great the the FI is helping as that is a LOT of petals.","Attachments":[],"Id":1127863,"PostDate":1272234452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm anxious too! Please post soon. Great the the FI is helping as that is a LOT of petals.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eyeversonluva3@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1265765914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225493.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JENISE","Id":225493,"Name":"JENISE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51182,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d658639e396de7ffe25d1b67aed0cb2","RawContent":"Hey girls!\n \n Here is the picture.\n First, you need to cover your table. Because the glue gun is hot and your table don&#039;t like that! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rofl.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rofl\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;HTML Code:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\"&gt;http:\/\/img94.imageshack.us\/i\/dscf4002q.jpg\/&lt;\/pre&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;You need to roll your aisle runner. Because if you have 25 ft. like us that a long piece of fabric.\n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;HTML Code:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\"&gt;http:\/\/img46.imageshack.us\/i\/img0003lh.jpg\/&lt;\/pre&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;We used 200 petals per 14 inches. That the cover that it give.\n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;HTML Code:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\"&gt;http:\/\/img689.imageshack.us\/i\/img0004il.jpg\/&lt;\/pre&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Finally, it&#039;s the monogram that I&#039;ve paint yesterday (around 6hrs of painting). I know i&#039;m slow but you need to take your time when you do a monogram. The first coat of paint was done with my laptop with a projector. The image was on the wall that I&#039;ve cover with wax paper. The second coat was done on my kitchen table. (Sorry I don&#039;t have any picture for the process of painting)\n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;HTML Code:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\"&gt;http:\/\/img35.imageshack.us\/i\/img0009et.jpg\/&lt;\/pre&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That&#039;s it! I want opinion!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/feedback.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Feedback\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n **Sorry I don&#039;t know how to post picture directly on the page... Just copy-paste the link to see the picture.","Attachments":[],"Id":1127955,"PostDate":1272237940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey girls!<br \/> <br \/> Here is the picture.<br \/> First, you need to cover your table. Because the glue gun is hot and your table don't like that! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rofl.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rofl\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">HTML Code:<\/div> <pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\">http:\/\/img94.imageshack.us\/i\/dscf4002q.jpg\/<\/pre> <\/div>You need to roll your aisle runner. Because if you have 25 ft. like us that a long piece of fabric.<br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">HTML Code:<\/div> <pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\">http:\/\/img46.imageshack.us\/i\/img0003lh.jpg\/<\/pre> <\/div>We used 200 petals per 14 inches. That the cover that it give.<br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">HTML Code:<\/div> <pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\">http:\/\/img689.imageshack.us\/i\/img0004il.jpg\/<\/pre> <\/div>Finally, it's the monogram that I've paint yesterday (around 6hrs of painting). I know i'm slow but you need to take your time when you do a monogram. The first coat of paint was done with my laptop with a projector. The image was on the wall that I've cover with wax paper. The second coat was done on my kitchen table. (Sorry I don't have any picture for the process of painting)<br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">HTML Code:<\/div> <pre class=\"alt2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 1px inset; width: 640px; height: 34px; text-align: left; overflow: auto\">http:\/\/img35.imageshack.us\/i\/img0009et.jpg\/<\/pre> <\/div>That's it! I want opinion!<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/feedback.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Feedback\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> **Sorry I don't know how to post picture directly on the page... Just copy-paste the link to see the picture.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>RIVIERA MAYA 2011<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wxXZqCZ\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...qCZ\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;128\/st\/20110412\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Paradise%21\/k\/e320\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e320\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cberg008@uottawa.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1269568492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226801.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"cus