se,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50681,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9ce7613bdaa3db2e1256e7afa7aa159","RawContent":"So this has been over the course of a year but WOW it&#039;s only 1 month away....\n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;Save the Dates &amp;amp; STD Letter:&lt;\/strong&gt; Used a lot of ideas from here (thanks everyone) This was the most time consuming but I loved how they turned out. Sorry about the glare on the newsletter.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0838.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0841.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Raffia Fans:&lt;\/strong&gt; I bought fans and starfish charms from Oriental Trading and wrapped with satin ribbon.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Wedding Week Survival Kits:&lt;\/strong&gt; To put in the OOT Bags\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6Immodium, Motrin, Bandaids, Powder packs of Gatorade, Aloe Vera, Off Wipes, Hand sanitizer, Shout wipes\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0861.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0858.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n Cake toppers: Bought from Michaels\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6..painted with glue and dipped in Martha Stewart glitter\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0835.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Luggage Tags &amp;amp; Pre-travel Newsletter:&lt;\/strong&gt; Bought the self laminate luggage tags from Target (4 to a pack) and then bought print yourself pop out business cards from Staples. Very easy to make!! Mailed the newsletter and luggage tags out this week (3 weeks prior)\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1011.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1012.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Playing Cards for OOT bags:&lt;\/strong&gt; Just used Sticker paper and printed them all then had to cut them out. It wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t as annoying as it sounds lol\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1015.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I think that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s it for my DIY stuff!! Thank you ladies for all of your inspiration. I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have done any of it without all of you!!! \n Feel free to ask me any questions or if you need anything!!!! \n \n -Nicole-","Attachments":[],"Id":1110022,"PostDate":1271091931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So this has been over the course of a year but WOW it's only 1 month away....<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong>Save the Dates & STD Letter:<\/strong> Used a lot of ideas from here (thanks everyone) This was the most time consuming but I loved how they turned out. Sorry about the glare on the newsletter.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0838.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0841.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <strong>Raffia Fans:<\/strong> I bought fans and starfish charms from Oriental Trading and wrapped with satin ribbon.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <strong>Wedding Week Survival Kits:<\/strong> To put in the OOT Bags\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6Immodium, Motrin, Bandaids, Powder packs of Gatorade, Aloe Vera, Off Wipes, Hand sanitizer, Shout wipes<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0861.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0858.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> Cake toppers: Bought from Michaels\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6..painted with glue and dipped in Martha Stewart glitter<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN0835.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <strong>Luggage Tags & Pre-travel Newsletter:<\/strong> Bought the self laminate luggage tags from Target (4 to a pack) and then bought print yourself pop out business cards from Staples. Very easy to make!! Mailed the newsletter and luggage tags out this week (3 weeks prior)<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1011.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1012.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <strong>Playing Cards for OOT bags:<\/strong> Just used Sticker paper and printed them all then had to cut them out. It wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t as annoying as it sounds lol\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1028.photobucket.com\/albums\/y345\/nicoleswrld\/DSCN1015.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I think that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s it for my DIY stuff!! Thank you ladies for all of your inspiration. I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have done any of it without all of you!!! <br \/> Feel free to ask me any questions or if you need anything!!!! <br \/> <br \/> -Nicole-\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20100513\/e\/Our+Beachy+Beach+Wedding\/k\/4058\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...4058\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nwante@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.69.215.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231367520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213698.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicoleswrld","Id":213698,"Name":"nicoleswrld","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50681,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73d23fc33be6642469490548e4f5f8f2","RawContent":"Great job!","Attachments":[],"Id":1110026,"PostDate":1271092080,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great job!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/nw.daisypath.com\/LvH3m3\/.png\">http:\/\/nw.daisypath.com\/LvH3m3\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hprentice_rda@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId"