er was fun and easy to use. I used a paint brush to paint on the glue and then sprinkled it with the glitter. I also bought wood letters for the I DO from Michaels painted then pink and glitter-fied them as well lol Forgot those pics....\n \n -Nicole-","Attachments":[],"Id":1110784,"PostDate":1271115721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies,<br \/> <br \/> Thanks for the positive feedback! The Gatorade powder packs I actually got from Rite Aid Pharmacy. <br \/> <br \/> The glitter was fun and easy to use. I used a paint brush to paint on the glue and then sprinkled it with the glitter. I also bought wood letters for the I DO from Michaels painted then pink and glitter-fied them as well lol Forgot those pics....<br \/> <br \/> -Nicole-\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20100513\/e\/Our+Beachy+Beach+Wedding\/k\/4058\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...4058\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nwante@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.69.215.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231367520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213698.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicoleswrld","Id":213698,"Name":"nicoleswrld","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddre